cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If PDEAtlas is useful in your work, please cite the software version you used."
title: "PDEAtlas: Partial Differential Equations in Lean"
abstract: >-
  PDEAtlas is a library of partial differential equations in Lean 4 and Mathlib. It follows Lawrence C.
  Evans's Partial Differential Equations, second edition, and formalizes selected results from every
  section of chapters 2 to 12: the four linear equations, first-order equations, Sobolev spaces,
  elliptic and evolution equations, the calculus of variations, Hamilton-Jacobi equations,
  conservation laws and nonlinear waves. Beyond the book it covers incompressible fluid mechanics.
